From 43f6438d6654f4556bdf46c8990909cde57a21aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Frederick F. Kautz IV" <fkautz@alumni.cmu.edu>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 20:33:55 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] pgalloc: save and restore memory as base plus delta

Record committed pages that match a shared base and omit them from the packed pages file. Restore overlays the base before applying only the remaining delta pages through both synchronous and asynchronous loaders.

Preserve zero pages that differ from non-zero base content, keep save/load walk ordering symmetric, and add round-trip and N-clone sharing coverage.
